IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 GRP1.
   05 X PIC 9 VALUE 1.
01 GRP2.
   05 X PIC 9 VALUE 2.
01 GRP3.
   05 X PIC 9 VALUE 3.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY X OF GRP1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING X DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE GRP1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY X OF GRP2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING X DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE GRP2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "2"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [2] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY X OF GRP3.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING X DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE GRP3 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "3"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [3] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

